        "original_id": "60ff3ec6-aa57-599c-b0df-8ee4c0a96148",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Westchester Knicks, NBA G League, National Basketball Association\n- Concepts: minor league basketball, affiliate relationships, league naming history\n\nFacts:\n- From 2001 to 2005, the NBA G League was known as the National Basketball Development League (NBDL).\n- From 2005 until 2017, the NBA G League was known as the NBA Development League (NBA D-League).\n- The NBA G League is the National Basketball Association's official minor league basketball organization.\n- The Westchester Knicks are an American professional basketball team in the NBA G League.\n- The Westchester Knicks are an affiliate of the New York Knicks in the National Basketball Association (NBA).",
